---
// LondonGuide.astro
const coffeeMapUrl = "https://maps.app.goo.gl/zCmWeUtELyHkAQiW9";
const taproomMapUrl = "https://maps.app.goo.gl/egQFtgJ4SHpDUike6";
---

<section id="london" class="london-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-badge-row">
      <span class="badge badge-coffee">📍 London City &amp; Craft Guide</span>
      <span class="badge">Roasteries • Beer Passport • Sourdough Bakeries</span>
    </div>

    <div class="london-header-row">
      <div class="london-header-text">
        <h2 class="heading-lg london-title">
          Exploring London: <span class="text-gradient-coffee">Beer, Sourdough &amp; Local Roasteries</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="london-desc">
          Beyond data pipelines, I have a deep love for the craft of fermentation and extraction. In London, that means stamping my <strong>Beer Passport</strong> across independent microbreweries and historic pubs, hunting down naturally leavened sourdough from neighborhood bakeries, and sourcing beans <em>strictly from London-based roasteries</em>.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="maps-cta-box card">
        <div class="maps-icon">🗺️</div>
        <div class="maps-text">
          <div class="maps-title">Robin's London Map</div>
          <div class="maps-sub">Saved roasteries, pubs &amp; bakeries</div>
        </div>
        <div class="maps-links">
          <a href={coffeeMapUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-coffee btn-sm">
            ☕ Coffee map ↗
          </a>
          <a href={taproomMapUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-coffee btn-sm">
            🍺 Taproom map ↗
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Craft & Home Brewing Spotlight Banner -->
    <div class="card craft-spotlight-card">
      <div class="craft-grid">
        <div class="craft-col">
          <div class="craft-badge badge-coffee font-mono">🍺 HOME BEER BREWING • PINTER</div>
          <h3 class="heading-sm craft-title">Fresh Draft Brewing with Pinter</h3>
          <p class="craft-text">
            Brewing fresh craft beer at home using my <strong>Pinter</strong>. Exploring cold conditioning, precise fermentation temperature control, and tapping fresh carbonated IPAs, hazy pales, and stouts straight from the draft handle.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="craft-col">
          <div class="craft-badge badge-data font-mono">🥖 SOURDOUGH FERMENTATION</div>
          <h3 class="heading-sm craft-title">Artisan Baking &amp; Wild Yeast</h3>
          <p class="craft-text">
            Fascinated by high-hydration doughs, open crumb structures, and wild lactobacillus fermentation. Constantly visiting London's artisan bakeries to analyze blistered crusts and baking sourdough at home.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="craft-col">
          <div class="craft-badge badge-ai font-mono">🛂 THE BEER PASSPORT</div>
          <h3 class="heading-sm craft-title">London Microbreweries &amp; Old Pubs</h3>
          <p class="craft-text">
            Proud holder of the <strong>London Beer Passport</strong>. Tracking independent railway arch taprooms (Bermondsey Beer Mile) and 400-year-old historic riverside coaching inns along the Thames.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="london-grid">
      <!-- Card 1: Strictly London Roasteries -->
      <div class="card guide-card">
        <div class="guide-badge badge-coffee">☕ London Roasteries Only</div>
        <h3 class="heading-sm guide-card-title">Local Roasting Pioneers</h3>
        <ul class="guide-list">
          <li>
            <strong>Assembly Coffee (Brixton)</strong>
            <span>Clean, expressive micro-lots; exceptional transparency in roast development.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>WatchHouse (Bermondsey / City)</strong>
            <span>Architectural brew bars highlighting rare anaerobic &amp; thermal shock Geishas.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Workshop Coffee (Marylebone)</strong>
            <span>Consistent benchmark Scandinavian roast profiles; stellar morning espresso.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Climpson &amp; Sons &amp; Origin</strong>
            <span>Pioneers of London specialty coffee; perfect single-origins for V60 dialing.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2: Beer Passport & Microbreweries -->
      <div class="card guide-card beer-card">
        <div class="guide-badge badge-coffee">🍺 Beer Passport &amp; Taprooms</div>
        <h3 class="heading-sm guide-card-title">Craft Breweries &amp; Old Pubs</h3>
        <ul class="guide-list">
          <li>
            <strong>Bermondsey Beer Mile</strong>
            <span>The Kernel, Anspach &amp; Hobday, Moor Beer, and Cloudwater taprooms under the brick arches.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>The Mayflower (Rotherhithe)</strong>
            <span>Historic 1620 Thames-side pub with a jetty over the river and cozy timber interiors.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>The Dove (Hammersmith)</strong>
            <span>Riverside terrace pub where Charles II romance was whispered; superb real ales.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Ye Olde Cheshire Cheese (Fleet St)</strong>
            <span>Rebuilt in 1667 after the Great Fire; atmospheric stone vaults and historic beers.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3: Artisan Bakeries & Sourdough -->
      <div class="card guide-card bakery-card">
        <div class="guide-badge badge-data">🥖 Artisan Sourdough Bakeries</div>
        <h3 class="heading-sm guide-card-title">Crust, Crumb &amp; Wild Yeast</h3>
        <ul class="guide-list">
          <li>
            <strong>The Dusty Knuckle (Dalston / Green Lanes)</strong>
            <span>Legendary potato sourdough loaves and blistered crusts that set the London standard.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Toad Bakery (Camberwell)</strong>
            <span>Unmatched creativity with whole grains, dark crusts, and morning pastries.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Jolene (Newington Green)</strong>
            <span>Wild fermented loaves milled from regenerative UK grains; extraordinary crumb.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>The Snapery &amp; E5 Bakehouse</strong>
            <span>Traditional sourdough heritage, community mills, and rich fermented sour tang.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 4: West London & Thames Riverside -->
      <div class="card guide-card west-london-card">
        <div class="guide-badge badge-data">🌊 West London &amp; Riverside</div>
        <h3 class="heading-sm guide-card-title">Kew, Richmond &amp; Chiswick</h3>
        <ul class="guide-list">
          <li>
            <strong>Kew Bridge &amp; Brentford Lock</strong>
            <span>Peaceful riverside paths, canal barges, and quiet weekend walks along the water.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Richmond Green &amp; Richmond Hill</strong>
            <span>Historic riverside strolls, craft taprooms, and the iconic Turner viewpoint.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Chiswick High Road &amp; Chief Coffee</strong>
            <span>Specialty roasts, artisan bakeries, and quiet leafy West London brunch spots.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Petersham Nurseries</strong>
            <span>Dining in a botanical glasshouse surrounded by fragrant jasmine and seasonal produce.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 5: Handcrafted Pasta & Italian -->
      <div class="card guide-card">
        <div class="guide-badge badge-ai">🍝 Fresh Pasta &amp; Italian</div>
        <h3 class="heading-sm guide-card-title">Craft &amp; Texture</h3>
        <ul class="guide-list">
          <li>
            <strong>Bancone (Covent Garden &amp; Soho)</strong>
            <span>Silk handkerchiefs with walnut butter and confit egg yolk; pure comfort.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Padella (Borough Market)</strong>
            <span>Pici cacio e pepe and slow-cooked beef shin ragu right alongside the food stalls.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Manteca (Shoreditch)</strong>
            <span>Nose-to-tail Italian with handmade duck ragu fazzoletti and wood-fired focaccia.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 6: Open-Fire & Regional Dining -->
      <div class="card guide-card">
        <div class="guide-badge badge-coffee">🔥 Wood-Fire &amp; Regional Flavors</div>
        <h3 class="heading-sm guide-card-title">Vibrant Dining Spaces</h3>
        <ul class="guide-list">
          <li>
            <strong>Kiln (Soho)</strong>
            <span>Charcoal clay pot cooking with northern Thai wood-fired herbs and spices.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Brat (Shoreditch)</strong>
            <span>Basque-inspired cooking: wood-fired bread, smoked potatoes, and wild turbot over embers.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Dishoom &amp; Roti King</strong>
            <span>24-hour slow-cooked Black Daal and freshly stretched flaky roti canai.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- The Weekend City Walk Routes -->
    <div class="walks-dual-grid">
      <div class="card walk-card">
        <div class="walk-header">
          <div class="walk-icon">🌊</div>
          <div>
            <span class="walk-tag font-mono">WEST LONDON RIVER &amp; SOURDOUGH</span>
            <h3 class="heading-sm walk-title">The Kew-to-Richmond River Walk</h3>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="walk-text">
          Grab a morning flat white near <strong>Kew Bridge</strong> ➔ Pick up a warm sourdough loaf along Chiswick High Road ➔ Walk the Thames towpath past Old Deer Park and the historic weir ➔ Stroll across Richmond riverside green and end with a pint of fresh cask ale at an old riverside pub.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card walk-card">
        <div class="walk-header">
          <div class="walk-icon">🍺</div>
          <div>
            <span class="walk-tag font-mono">BEER PASSPORT &amp; ROASTERIES</span>
            <h3 class="heading-sm walk-title">The Bermondsey Mile &amp; South Bank Route</h3>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="walk-text">
          Start with a single-origin V60 at <strong>WatchHouse Bermondsey</strong> ➔ Pick up a loaf at The Snapery Bakery ➔ Walk down the railway arches stamping your Beer Passport at <strong>The Kernel</strong> &amp; <strong>Anspach &amp; Hobday</strong> ➔ Finish crossing London Bridge towards the historic City alleyways.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .london-section {
    padding: 5rem 0;
    position: relative;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }

  .london-header-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.75rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 860px) {
    .london-header-row {
      flex-direction: row;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
    }
  }

  .london-header-text {
    max-width: 680px;
  }

  .london-title {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .london-desc {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .maps-cta-box {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    background: var(--bg-tertiary);
    border-color: rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.35);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .maps-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .maps-icon {
    font-size: 2rem;
  }

  .maps-text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .maps-title {
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .maps-sub {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .btn-sm {
    padding: 0.45rem 0.85rem;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }

  .craft-spotlight-card {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.08) 0%, rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.06) 50%, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.06) 100%);
    border-color: rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.3);
    padding: 2.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .craft-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 860px) {
    .craft-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .craft-col {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }

  .craft-badge {
    align-self: flex-start;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
  }

  .craft-title {
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .craft-text {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.885rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .craft-text strong {
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .london-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .london-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .london-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .guide-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .beer-card {
    border-color: rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.3);
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.05) 0%, var(--bg-card) 100%);
  }

  .bakery-card {
    border-color: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.3);
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.05) 0%, var(--bg-card) 100%);
  }

  .west-london-card {
    border-color: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.3);
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.05) 0%, var(--bg-card) 100%);
  }

  .guide-badge {
    align-self: flex-start;
  }

  .guide-card-title {
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .guide-list {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .guide-list li {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.2rem;
  }

  .guide-list strong {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-size: 0.925rem;
  }

  .guide-list span {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.825rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .walks-dual-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .walks-dual-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .walk-card {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.04) 0%, var(--bg-card) 100%);
    border-color: rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.25);
    padding: 1.75rem 2rem;
  }

  .walk-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .walk-icon {
    font-size: 2rem;
  }

  .walk-tag {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--accent-coffee-light);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .walk-title {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-top: 0.15rem;
  }

  .walk-text {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.925rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .walk-text strong {
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }
</style>
